# The split quadric

The coordinate algebra of `wz - xy = 0` over an arbitrary commutative ring,
its injective parametrization with range `theta.range`, its domain and
primality criteria, and the comparison of its `w`-chart with the parameter
algebra's `W`-chart.

The basic constructions, exponent arithmetic, monomial reduction, coefficient
retraction, kernel theorem and consequences are re-exported through this root.
